  {
   "s": "SHAKTIPUMP",
   "n": "Shakti Pumps (India) Limited",
   "cat": "Acquisition",
   "when": "2026-11-21 18:29",
   "sent": "positive",
   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**  \nShakti Pumps (India) Limited has invested **Rs. 30,24,23,900/-** in cash into its wholly owned subsidiary, **Shakti Energy Solutions Limited (SESL)**, to set up a greenfield 2.20 GW capacity manufacturing plant for high-efficiency Solar DCR cells and Solar PV modules in Pithampur, Madhya Pradesh.\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**  \n* **Investment Amount:** Rs. 30,24,23,900/- (Rupees Thirty Crore Twenty-Four Lakh Twenty-Three Thousand Nine Hundred Only) via equity subscription.  \n* **Planned Plant Capacity:** 2.20 GW (Solar DCR cells and Solar PV modules).  \n* **SESL Historical Turnover:**  \n  * **FY 2026:** Rs. 239.11 Crores  \n  * **FY 2025:** Rs. 216.53 Crores  \n  * **FY 2024:** Rs. 139.59 Crores  \n*(Note: EBITDA, PAT, margins, and deltas are not stated in the filing).*\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Forward-Looking Statements**  \n* The subsidiary is expanding from its existing business (solar structures and solar rooftop) into establishing a greenfield high-efficiency Solar DCR cell and Solar PV modules manufacturing facility with an expected production capacity of **2.20 GW** in Pithampur, MP.  \n* Equity shares in SESL will be issued to the parent company from time to time as per agreement.\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**  \n* **Execution & Capex:** Progress and project timeline for commissioning the 2.20 GW solar cell and module facility.  \n* **Total Project Outlay & Funding:** Watch for any further capital infusions, debt tie-ups, or capex announcements required to fully fund a 2.20 GW manufacturing setup.\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**  \n**Positive:** Strategic backward-integration move into solar cell and module manufacturing (2.20 GW), strengthening supply security and margin capture for its solar pump solutions."
  }
 ],
